  - “If I’m on apixaban, do we need to check kidney function to confirm the correct dose?”
  - “Are any of my medications contributing to anemia or affecting blood pressure control?”
- Hypertension management
  - “What is my current BP target given my age and other conditions?”
  - “Would you like me to keep a home BP log for X weeks before adjusting meds? If so, when and how should I measure?”
  - “If my BP is not at goal, what medication changes would you consider (and any pros/cons)?”
  - “Are there lifestyle changes or referral options (e.g., dietitian, exercise, sleep apnea evaluation) you recommend?”
- Anticoagulation & bleeding/anemia
  - “Given my anemia, do you think my anticoagulation plan should be reassessed?”
  - “Do we need to investigate causes of anemia (CBC, iron studies, stool occult blood, GI referral) before continuing current anticoagulation?”
  - “If I was on warfarin and the INR was 3.20, was any action taken? Is that concerning for me?”
