  - “Can we get an updated CBC (for anemia), BMP/CMP (including creatinine), lipid panel, HbA1c, TSH, and urine albumin-to-creatinine ratio?”
  - “Would an ECG or echocardiogram be useful given my anticoagulation/hypertension history?”
- Referral questions
  - “Do you recommend a referral to cardiology (Colorado Cardiology) given my age, anticoagulation, and hypertension? If so, for what specific reason (arrhythmia, structural evaluation, second opinion on anticoagulation)?”
